Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.45,0:00:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there they are, the five\Nbad guys, cried the brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.37,0:00:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the brothers wondered, what\Ncould they be talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.75,0:00:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bad guys seemed so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.63,0:00:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.67,0:00:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that's them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.25,0:00:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little did they know,\Nthey had drunk poison tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.61,0:00:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.93,0:00:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brother, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earth's a big bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.75,0:00:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.91,0:00:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.71,0:00:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I just have to poison them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.69,0:00:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, little bro,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.11,0:01:02.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you and I are practically invincible together\Nbetween your clairvoyant comic, Stan,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.21,0:01:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and my face, Stan's\Ntransformative ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.01,0:01:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one can get in our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.95,0:01:12.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys are as good as dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.11,0:01:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We possess the cards known\Nas Death, the god of writing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.97,0:01:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and K 'nom, the god of creation!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.77,0:01:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and together we are the\Nbestest brothers ever!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.54,0:01:27.37,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,952.999)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.97,0:02:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.21,0:02:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell! Hell! Hell! Hell! Hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.09,0:02:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell!
Dialogue: 2,0:02:52.92,0:02:58.17,Title 3,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(688,975)\pos(200,750)}Episode 27: \NKhnum's Zenyatta and Thoth's Mondatta {Working file name: SC_27_Drinking_Bad_Tea_Makes_You_Shit_Out_Your.ass}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.07,0:02:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.98,0:02:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh-oh-oh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.95,0:03:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's here in this cafe,\Nright at that table.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.93,0:03:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where those guys\Nwill drink their poison tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.51,0:03:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.49,0:03:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my Stan Thoth, the god of writing,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.45,0:03:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has never been wrong about anything\Nwhen it comes to predictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.57,0:03:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, are they going to pull through?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.89,0:03:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.80,0:03:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol's major arteries weren't damaged,\Nso he'll probably be released by tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.47,0:03:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Kakyoin, on the other hand, has\Nserious injuries that need to be treated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.47,0:03:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a chance he could go blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.31,0:03:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a raw deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.73,0:03:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but if his\Ncondition doesn't improve soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.71,0:03:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we might have to leave him behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.31,0:03:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.35,0:04:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, since there are so many cafes nearby,\Nhow about we get ourselves a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.45,0:04:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.77,0:04:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one did you have in mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.33,0:04:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.91,0:04:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cigarette has spoken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.37,0:04:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.19,0:04:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, sirs, how may I be of service?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.37,0:04:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, tea sounds good\Nright about now. Same.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.23,0:04:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, so three teas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.03,0:04:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be back in a jiffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.67,0:04:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, scratch that order\Nif you would. Huh? Hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.93,0:04:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in enemy territory here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.75,0:04:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Dio's dominion, and since we\Ndon't know when enemies will attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.39,0:04:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we have to be cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.75,0:04:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we let our guard down, even for\Na second, someone could poison us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.49,0:04:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From this point on, we're only\Ndrinking from bottles and cans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.87,0:04:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.78,0:04:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious? Completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.05,0:04:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, you can forget the\Ntea and bring us colas instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.73,0:04:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.65,0:04:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cola!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.19,0:04:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.45,0:05:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.36,0:05:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all. Okay. Three colas coming\Nup. Hmm. I'll just go and grab.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.77,0:05:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them oh by the way if you don't\Nmind we'll open them ourselves
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.83,0:05:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and to make sure we're not falling\Nvictim to any funny business
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.71,0:05:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,give us the third fourth and\Nfifth ones from the far right
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.29,0:05:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,side now they want unopened\Ncolas how am I supposed to put
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.75,0:05:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,poison in those was the prediction\Nwrong no that can't be it my
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.91,0:05:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,brother's comic is always right\Ndamn it I've got to get it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.51,0:05:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,together I just have to believe\Nif I don't have absolute faith in
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.47,0:05:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,little bro we won't stand a\Nchance yes my predictions are
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.15,0:05:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,foolproof brother you in the apron\Nis this warm cola your idea of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.33,0:05:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a cold drink you must assume\NI'm a real half-wit or something
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.25,0:05:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to think I'd pay for this excuse\Nof a beverage wait what the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.83,0:05:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,coal is really not cold sorry\Nabout the hassle the fridge is
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.39,0:05:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,down so hey don't you think you're\Nbeing a little paranoid let's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.17,0:05:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,say for the sake of argument\Nthat guy was our enemy and he was
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.03,0:05:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trying has damned us to slip a\Nlittle poison into our drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.25,0:06:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would he have known to\Ncome to this exact cafe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.27,0:06:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, the city's not lacking\Nin places to get a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.89,0:06:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I chose this one on a whim.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.69,0:06:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd understand if this were the only\Ncafe, but there are tons of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.89,0:06:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My point is, we can't be\Ntoo careful around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.71,0:06:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you're that worried,\Nlet's go somewhere else then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.63,0:06:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe the place across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.47,0:06:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.43,0:06:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My cafe is on fire! Ow! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.85,0:06:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some fool left a burning cigarette\Nin the road and it ignited the trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.71,0:06:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.71,0:06:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.73,0:06:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we'll take those teas after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.85,0:06:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.51,0:06:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zootalor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of jerk would toss a\Nlit cigarette near the trash?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.49,0:06:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, the nerve of some people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.69,0:06:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, they're drinking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.43,0:06:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drink it. Drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.19,0:06:56.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drink it till it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.89,0:07:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They drank it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.27,0:07:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dog just took my cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.17,0:07:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell brought a mangy\Nmutt to a freakin' cafe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.03,0:07:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.17,0:07:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will somebody please get\Nthis dog out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.39,0:07:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, Iggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.93,0:07:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here, you fleabag!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.05,0:07:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.53,0:07:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were just about\Nto swallow the poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.01,0:07:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dumb mutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.05,0:07:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what the hell's\Nsupposed to happen next?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.43,0:07:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, thing is, the page\Nhasn't appeared yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.03,0:07:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, while off, it wasn't\Nentirely wrong. Be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.07,0:07:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thoth only has the ability to see\Nthe near future, so patience is key.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.27,0:07:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.23,0:07:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the next premonition is revealed,\Nwe'll use it to destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.27,0:07:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what we were meant to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.09,0:07:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together, we're the bestest\Nbrothers ever, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.15,0:07:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We failed to kill them\Nbecause of that darn dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.07,0:08:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were so close, Fume, the brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.11,0:08:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The brothers were beside themselves\Nwith anger because their plan failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.53,0:08:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the brothers didn't give up,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.39,0:08:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and soon they decided to follow\Nthe three guys and their dog.
