Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.11,0:08:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the kind of face that was\Njust begging to be hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.89,0:08:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, it was the kind\Nof face the brothers hated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.67,0:08:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must have hated that\Nface in a past life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.81,0:08:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a face like that\Ndeserves a knuckle sandwich.
