Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.33,0:08:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thus, the man with the bad face ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.33,0:08:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But fortunately for them, he\Ndropped a wallet full of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.13,0:08:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay, we're rich!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.49,0:08:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoopee, cried Mondatta.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.97,0:08:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.85,0:08:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks to that\Nsmarmy-faced fool, we're rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.21,0:08:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, brother, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.23,0:08:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The new page is coming.
