Dialogue: 2,0:09:49.82,0:09:52.66,SFXComic4,9,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur1\frz345.4\pos(1496.428,641.715)\4a&HFF&}Kablam
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.99,0:09:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true that my Stand, Tohth,\Ncan only see the near future,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.87,0:10:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and most would see that\Nas a disadvantage, but
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.47,0:10:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,once the prediction has been printed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.53,0:10:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it can't be changed no\Nmatter what anybody does.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.23,0:10:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.19,0:10:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna blow Jotaro to smithereens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.23,0:10:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bomb will detonate three seconds\Nafter he sticks his finger in to peel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.49,0:10:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.49,0:10:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.11,0:10:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.67,0:10:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is in our car?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.59,0:10:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you recognize this bozo? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.57,0:10:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it Jotaro? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.75,0:10:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro said he was going\Nstraight to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.13,0:10:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.04,0:10:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.87,0:10:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.89,0:10:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Joestar and Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.69,0:10:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever you are, come out this instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.77,0:10:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What he said, out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.57,0:10:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit your stolen and get\Nout of there already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.87,0:10:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it snappy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.19,0:10:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, what's the matter with you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.57,0:10:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was me, couldn't you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.63,0:10:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so it was you, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.99,0:11:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand, Kanam, gives me\Nthe power of transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.55,0:11:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can alter my height, weight,\Nand scent however I see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.15,0:11:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I even used my hair to recreate this hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.57,0:11:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.01,0:11:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last I heard, you said you were going\Nto head straight for the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.35,0:11:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.25,0:11:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.57,0:11:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot something, so I\Ndecided to come and get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.86,0:11:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left my wallet in the car. Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.15,0:11:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, where's your school uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.15,0:11:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.27,0:11:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.61,0:11:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What school uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.11,0:11:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing personal, friend, but that's\Nnot really a good look on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.65,0:11:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, my outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.77,0:11:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.09,0:11:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's actually at the dry cleaners.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.49,0:11:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took it in for a wash, but then\NI realized I didn't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.09,0:11:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that'll convince them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.81,0:11:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.85,0:11:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so. All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.99,0:11:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can go ahead and hop in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.03,0:11:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.55,0:12:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Not the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.69,0:12:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then that would mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.29,0:12:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.15,0:12:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I get into the car with this face,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.41,0:12:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that means the real Jotaro won't\Nbe the one getting blown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.15,0:12:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead, it'll be me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.79,0:12:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.97,0:12:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, it's a beautiful day out,\Nso I think I'll go for a stroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.25,0:12:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to wait\Nfor you to walk there, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.59,0:12:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things will go a lot faster if you just\Nget in the car and ride over with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.85,0:12:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brother, you have to get out of there now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.75,0:12:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.71,0:12:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to undo my Jotaro\Ndisguise before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.69,0:12:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't, I'll be the\None who gets blown to bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.83,0:12:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.71,0:12:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need to throw it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.49,0:12:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll covertly get rid of this one\Nand put another one in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.01,0:12:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,later so it can blow up the real\NJotaro thereby saving my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.31,0:12:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.99,0:13:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.11,0:13:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.33,0:13:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you know? It's Iggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.49,0:13:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's chasing our car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.13,0:13:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got an orange in his mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.75,0:13:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you steal that, Iggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.35,0:13:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll make a nice gift\Nfor Kakyoin. An Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.01,0:13:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Yow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.05,0:13:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.96,0:13:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.17,0:13:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never thought I'd hear you\Nsay something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.25,0:13:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, really? That's weird. Yow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.35,0:13:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, yow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.73,0:13:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I was pointing\Nout that there's a cow
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.51,0:13:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over there. A cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.01,0:13:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, you sure are acting\Npretty peculiar today, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.55,0:13:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're usually a lot\Ncooler. I hate to say this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.75,0:13:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I've got to wonder\Nyou're not really a fake
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.39,0:13:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you Jotaro
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.43,0:13:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,good
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.57,0:13:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,grief
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.49,0:13:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Balmer F what the hell
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.63,0:13:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you even talking\Nabout man by By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.03,0:14:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are we at the hospital yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.65,0:14:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro, I'm super bored, so how\Nabout you show me that trick again?
