Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.27,0:14:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.27,0:14:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.69,0:14:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.25,0:14:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one you taught me a while back?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.71,0:14:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, this one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.85,0:14:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you've gotten a bit\Nbetter at that, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.77,0:14:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's the trick\Nyou were talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.75,0:14:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.91,0:14:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know how to do that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.37,0:14:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's risky, but I can pull it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.23,0:14:40.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say so from the beginning?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.29,0:14:41.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's an easy one. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.07,0:14:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, do the one\Nwith five cigarettes then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.07,0:14:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five cigarettes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.69,0:14:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up already, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.49,0:14:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to see the trick again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.01,0:14:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.19,0:14:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that Jotaro and damn\Nhis stupid party tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.47,0:15:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I don't at least try to do it,\Nthey'll really think something is up,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.55,0:15:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they're already becoming more\Nsuspicious of me by the minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.55,0:15:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Polnareff,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.85,0:15:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,loathsome idiot that he is, is seconds\Naway from setting off the bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.89,0:15:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, fine, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.97,0:15:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.41,0:15:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have it your way, five cigarettes.
