Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.03,0:15:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the way, now come on, do the trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.95,0:15:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, it's now or never.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.81,0:15:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna do it, I'm gonna\Ndo the trick, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.53,0:15:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it, hot damn, I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.63,0:15:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There! Did you see that? I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.27,0:15:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A man can do anything when\Nhis life is on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.83,0:15:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.74,0:15:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last time you did this super\Ncool move where you drank
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.83,0:16:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a bottle of juice without\Nputting the cigarettes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.59,0:16:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, drink up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.93,0:16:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you blew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.19,0:16:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.73,0:16:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.01,0:16:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.93,0:16:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brother, please! Blue bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.25,0:16:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make that prediction go away right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.65,0:16:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tear up that page!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.07,0:16:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, big bro, but the\Nprediction can't be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.29,0:16:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry and go back to your regular self!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.23,0:16:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can undo the disguise, the\Nreal Jotaro will get blown up instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.33,0:16:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe in you, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.71,0:16:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, I know we've said this already,\Nbut you're acting really weird today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.91,0:16:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.19,0:16:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just feel a little\Nunder the weather is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.63,0:16:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, this couldn't get any worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.15,0:17:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know their type.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.49,0:17:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since I've put them on guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.31,0:17:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're going to interrogate\Nme and realize I'm an imposter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.25,0:17:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they figure me out, they'll kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.41,0:17:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I don't undo my disguise, I'll\Nblow up just like the prophecy said.
