Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.45,0:17:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, I couldn't help but notice\Nthe way you're clasping your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.51,0:17:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.42,0:17:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you aware you've got your\Nleft thumb on top of the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.11,0:17:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.93,0:17:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I wasn't prepared for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.47,0:17:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does Jotaro have a weird\Ntick that causes him
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.59,0:17:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to clasp his hands with\Nhis right thumb on top?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.93,0:17:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who even notices something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.61,0:17:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.51,0:17:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That just proves beyond a shadow of a\Ndoubt that you are a woman in a past life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.91,0:17:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since unlike you, I always\Nput my right thumb on top,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.13,0:17:55.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it proves that I was\Na man in my past life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.59,0:17:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, now how about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.37,0:17:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always put my left thumb on top as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.47,0:18:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.38,0:18:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, but that proves you\Ntoo were a woman in a past life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.45,0:18:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Says you, how does it prove anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.01,0:18:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do thumbs factor into reincarnation?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.49,0:18:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.05,0:18:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I really do feel sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.59,0:18:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beast-rabbit lunatics are\Ndriving me up the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.21,0:18:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll tell them\NI've got a stomachache.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.35,0:18:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, what do you say we find out which\None of us can eat an orange the fastest?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.47,0:18:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.37,0:18:33.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, maybe you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.59,0:18:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.93,0:18:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do that, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.47,0:18:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.38,0:18:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.57,0:18:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on with you today, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.49,0:18:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.59,0:18:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this isn't like you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.51,0:18:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't think it's good for\Nyou to eat that particular orange.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.21,0:18:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the problem with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.75,0:18:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's obvious, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.97,0:18:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows where the heck\NIggy found that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.41,0:18:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For all we know, he could\Nhave dug it out of the gutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.29,0:19:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should eat a different one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.51,0:19:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for caring, but it doesn't look\Nbruised or dirty, so I think I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.37,0:19:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll eat this one, and\Nyou can have one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.67,0:19:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see the look\Non your face when I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.35,0:19:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow! The pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.29,0:19:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.20,0:19:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.12,0:19:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.03,0:19:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.67,0:19:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, stop the car. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.13,0:19:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does your stomach really hurt that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.21,0:19:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hold it anymore!\NLet me out! Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.01,0:19:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go behind that rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.19,0:19:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hospitals right there just hang\Non no no going ahead without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.77,0:19:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up once I'm done
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.03,0:19:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast Jotaro
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.77,0:20:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this, it's... Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.97,0:20:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.07,0:20:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.99,0:20:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I actually managed to get out\Nof that metal death trap alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.13,0:20:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go behind that rock\Nand undo my disguise!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.65,0:20:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He brought up a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.41,0:20:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows where Iggy found this orange?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.33,0:20:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For all we know, it could\Nhave been lying in the gutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.91,0:20:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.75,0:20:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, you can toss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.57,0:20:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Success!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.79,0:20:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can use K 'num's powers\Nto transform back to normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.13,0:20:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, they'll get\Nwhat's coming to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.29,0:20:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the Dinyana Maiden\Nbrothers will have won again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.61,0:20:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We win!
