Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.19,0:20:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.39,0:21:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.67,0:21:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.81,0:21:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was probably construction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.47,0:21:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big bro, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.23,0:21:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speak to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.69,0:21:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, little bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.33,0:21:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we lost this\Nbattle. Bad. Really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.75,0:21:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.75,0:21:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.31,0:21:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those wannabes haven't beaten\Nme and my Stan Thoth yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.27,0:21:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy them all, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.19,0:21:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By myself if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.15,0:21:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.67,0:21:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do this, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.37,0:21:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys aren't some rookies\Nyou can push around. You'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.71,0:21:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already decided and\NI can beat them on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.33,0:21:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I can
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.19,0:21:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were always so shy you've\Nreally grown up little bro
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.23,0:21:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.03,0:21:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does the book of thoughts say next?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.97,0:21:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is them, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.89,0:22:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the ones who punched me and\Npurloined my wallet while they were at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.77,0:22:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.68,0:22:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beat them to a bloody pulp, and I'll\Nmake sure you're rewarded handsomely.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.69,0:22:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.01,0:22:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm scared, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.33,0:22:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't look good for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.03,0:22:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite his intense yet\Nshort-lived burst of bravery,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.73,0:22:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mondatta would have to wait a\Nwhile to avenge his brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.35,0:22:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But try not to lose heart, Mondatta.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.89,0:22:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Life is full of wonderful\Nups and terrible downs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.71,0:22:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.62,0:22:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't Jotaro? Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.51,0:22:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what took so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.09,0:22:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.43,0:22:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you take a dump behind\Nthat rock so fast? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.81,0:22:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you got here before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.95,0:22:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You even found time to\Ngo to the dry cleaners.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.67,0:22:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you two talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.95,0:22:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's an ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.75,0:22:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone must be heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.95,0:22:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, man, that's unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.45,0:22:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.53,0:22:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oranges, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.75,0:22:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just getting thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.85,0:22:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think I'll take one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.27,0:23:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.45,0:23:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.63,0:23:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man's clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.25,0:23:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You recognize him?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.39,0:23:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, can't say that I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.79,0:23:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, let's go find out how\NAvdol and Kakyoin are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.67,0:23:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
