Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.01,0:23:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.49,0:23:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.29,0:23:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oingo! Oingo! Brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.97,0:23:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can move on to Oingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.61,0:24:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since then, till I saw you,\Nknow what I'm trying to
Dialogue: 1,0:24:56.57,0:24:58.58,Next Episode,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,730)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.31,0:24:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! It's a katana!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.01,0:25:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you find that sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.65,0:25:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The damn thing won't budge!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.45,0:25:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell won't it come out?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.55,0:25:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll hack you to\Npieces while I'm on a roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.65,0:25:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shall wield me, and you shall kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.37,0:25:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see if your Anubis stand\Nis all it's cracked up to be.
